<title>USA: Vitalink Pharmacy adds 5,000 beds to base.</title>
<headline>Vitalink Pharmacy adds 5,000 beds to base.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc said on Friday it has added more than 5,000 new beds to its customer base since its February 13 merger with TeamCare, the pharmacy subsidiary of GranCare Inc.</p>
<p>As of April 1, the company served 172,000 beds from 56 locations in the United States.</p>
<p>Vitalink provides medications, consulting, infusion services and ancillary services to hospitals and other care facilities.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
